# text-analyzer: three sentences with a file name, a decimal and a version
$ cat notes.txt
Open input.txt and report the totals. Pi is 3.14. Ship v1.2.3 today.
# Before: upstream main 9757f986
$ python3 before/analyze_text.py --file notes.txt --json | jq -c '{word_count, sentence_count}'
{"word_count":12,"sentence_count":7}
